[108.238, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G \u001b[4G as the\u001b[12Grules\u001b[18Grequire.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B - For inputs the\u001b[20Ginterface doesn't define, I made choices: FIXED/LOGITS\u001b[75Gw\u001b[77Gth\u001b[80Gmore than 1024 ids process\u001b[107Gonly the\u001b[116Gfirst\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[4G 1024, and bad ids or an unwritable\u001b[40GLOGITS path answer \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mERR ...\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B - Speed is \u001b[15Gbout 65\u201372\u001b[26Gtokens/s on th\u001b[41Gs machine with Accelerate's\u001b[69Gdefault\u001b[77Gthreading.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B NOTES.md\u001b[12Grecords the build command,\u001b[39Gevery command\u001b[53GI\u001b[55Gran,\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gthese\u001b[70Gpoints\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gmore\u001b[85Gdetail.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u273b\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mCrunched for 4m 51s \u00b7 done 4:20 PM\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this implementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;"]
[108.239, "2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m I'll\u001b[9Gtart by finding\u001b[25Gthe developm\u001b[38Gnt\u001b[41Gwo\u001b[44Gkloads\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gmeasuring\u001b[65Ga\u001b[67Gbaseline.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[27G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m I'm benchmarking\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gthree fixture prompts on this M1 (8 GB),\u001b[65Gwith Accelerate tested\u001b[88Gboth single-threaded and at\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B default threading.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Baseline holds at\u001b[21Gabout\u001b[27G14 ms per forward\u001b[45Gpass (~70 tokens/s)\u001b[65Gwith either\u001b[77Gthread setting,\u001b[93Gwhich works\u001b[105Gout to\u001b[112Groughly\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B 31 GB/s\u001b[11Gof we\u001b[17Gght\u001b[21Greads. I'm adding optional timers\u001b[55Gnext to see\u001b[67Gwhere\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gtime\u001b[82Ggoes\u001b[87Ginside\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gforward\u001b[104Gpass.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[3"]
