[275.324, "\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll start by finding\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gdevelopment\u001b[41Gworkloads\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gmeasuring\u001b[65Ga\u001b[67Gbaseline.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm\u001b[7Gbenchmarking\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gthree\u001b[30Gfixture\u001b[38Gprompts\u001b[46Gon\u001b[49Gthis\u001b[54GM1\u001b[57G(8\u001b[60GGB),\u001b[65Gwith\u001b[70GAccelerate\u001b[81Gtested\u001b[88Gboth\u001b[93Gsingle-threaded\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gat\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdefault threading.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBaseline\u001b[12Gholds\u001b[18Gat\u001b[21Gabout\u001b[27G14\u001b[30Gms\u001b[33Gper\u001b[37Gforward\u001b[45Gpass\u001b[50G(~70\u001b[55Gtokens/s)\u001b[65Gwith\u001b[70Geither\u001b[77Gthread\u001b[84Gsetting,\u001b[93Gwhi"]
