[310.641, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[4BThe\u001b[7Gpure-BLAS flo\u001b[21Gr is about 11.9 ms pe\u001b[43G token, yet\u001b[55Gthe program takes 13.3 ms, so I suspect the weight\u001b[106Glayout scatters\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Be\u001b[5Gch token's reads a\u001b[24Gross sev\u001b[33Gn memory regions. I'll\u001b[56Greorder the weights\u001b[76Glayer by layer and lo\u001b[98Gd them with pread in\u001b[119Go\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Galigned\u001b[15Gbuffer,\u001b[23Gdropping\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gmmap-then-copy\u001b[51Gstep.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLoad\u001b[9Gim\u001b[12G droppe\u001b[20G from about 1.0 s to 0.07\u20130.2 s, but pe\u001b[60G-token sp\u001b[70Ged stayed within noise near 70 forwards/s. Next\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll compare mean an\u001b[24G best-of in\u001b[36Gthe microbenchmark and\u001b[59Gcheck\u001b[65Gsystem\u001b[72Gload\u001b[77Gfor\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gsteadier\u001b[92Gnumber.\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102man \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m she\u001b[13Gl command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BThe microbenchmark's ~12.5 ms/token is the realistic floor, and\u001b[67Gth\u001b[70G program sits at\u001b[87G~14.5\u001b[93Gms per forward. Next I'll\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Badd a "]
