[710.87, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Load\u001b[8Gaverage is 5.4 on\u001b[26G8 cor\u001b[32Gs, so single runs are \u001b[55Gnr\u001b[58Gliable; I'll compare the four variants\u001b[97Gplus\u001b[102Gtwo\u001b[106Gother\u001b[112GBLAS\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B calls using interleaved,\u001b[28Grepeated runs and medians.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The\u001b[7Gaccess-ordered\u001b[22Glayout wins at \u001b[38Gbout 13.3 ms per \u001b[56Gorward, ahead\u001b[70Gof\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Galigned\u001b[85Gcopy\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Goriginal\u001b[107Gmmap,\u001b[113Gwhile\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B the\u001b[7Gother\u001b[13Gsgemm and sgemv variants gave no gai\u001b[50G, so I'm keeping the plain\u001b[77GRowMajor\u001b[86Gsgemv.\u001b[93GNext\u001b[98GI'll\u001b[103Gprofile\u001b[111Gattention\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B at\u001b[6Glong context, since\u001b[26GGENERATE\u001b[35Gcan\u001b[39Greach\u001b[45G1024 positions.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Attention now takes\u001b[23G15%\u001b[27Gof\u001b[30Gthe forw\u001b[39Grd pass because the\u001b[59GKV\u001b[62Gcache\u001b[68Gis\u001b[71Glaid\u001b[76Gout\u001b"]
[710.871, "[80G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m[layer][pos][kv_dim]\u001b[39m,\u001b[102Gso\u001b[105Geach\u001b[110Ghead's\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B 256-byte rows\u001b[17Gare\u001b[21Gstrided 3 KB apart.\u001b[41GI'm switching\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gcache\u001b[65Gto\u001b[68Ghead-major\u001b[79Gorder\u001b[85Gso\u001b[88Geach\u001b[93Ghead's\u001b[100GK/V\u001b[104Gblock\u001b[110Gis\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B contiguous.\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Checks pass. The fixtures only cover\u001b[40Gshort\u001b[46Gsequences,\u001b[57Gso\u001b[60GI'll\u001b[65Gcompare\u001b[73Gfull\u001b[78G1024-position\u001b[92Glogits\u001b[99Gagainst\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gprevious\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B build\u001b[9G(old\u001b[14Gcache\u001b[20Glayout)\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gre-profile\u001b[43Gattention.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Th\u001b[6G head-majo\u001b[17G cache matches the old logits exactly\u001b[55Gacross\u001b[62Gall\u001b[66G1024\u001b[71Gpositions\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gcut\u001b[89Gattention\u001b[99Gfrom\u001b[104G2.5\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111G1.8\u001b[115Gms\u001b[118Gper\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B forward. Next I'll split attention into its\u001b[4"]
[710.872, "7Gsc\u001b[50Gr\u001b[52G, softmax, and value steps \u001b[80Go find the remaining\u001b[101Gcost.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m \u001b[39m Break down attention time at long context\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  $ cd /tmp/cbtest && python3 - <<'EOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[4G  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102ms = open('/Users/agentlab/pvc/cb/cb.c').read()\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;102;102;102ms = s.replace('static double PT[P_N];', 'static double PT[P_N]; static double AT[3];')\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B    \u001b[38;2;102;102;102ms = s.replace(''' cblas_sgemv(CblasRowMajor, CblasNoTrans, pos + 1, head_size, 1.0f,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bkbase, head_size, q, 1, 0.0f, att, 1);''',\u2026\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u2733\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;245;149;117mTwisting\u2026\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(11m 37s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[26G25.6k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B          \u001b[18G        \u001b[103G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u25cf high \u00b7 /effort\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;138;138;138m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
